/span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n           Caturra\n          </span>\n</em>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Washed\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Onyx - Peru\n          <strong>\n           Cajamarca\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n           La Peña Santo Becerra\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">\n           Caturra/Bourbon/Pache/Typica\n          </span>\n</em>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Washed\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Workshop - Ecuador\n          <strong>\n           Pichincha Nanegal\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n           Alambi\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);font-size: 14px;\">\n           Typica Mejorado, Tekisic &amp; Sidra\n          </span>\n</em>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Washed\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          关于这三个品种\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<em>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;caret-color: rgb(64, 64, 64);color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">\n            ‘\n           </span>\n</em>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n<em>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;caret-color: rgb(64, 64, 64);color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">\n              Typica Mejorado’\n             </span>\n</em>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<em>\n<span s